    <description>When a voice call is created or updated and Accepted in null, try to find the user with the phone number matching the call recipient and assign them as the Voice Call owner.

Hot Fix - NOT( Outbound), criteria was wrong
Hot Fix - Changed criteria so it runs on ever update when is accepted is null because it wasn&apos;t working in some scenarios</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>adjustedUserId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!Get_User_by_Normalized_Phone_Number.Id},15)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>areacode</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>MID({!$Record.FromPhoneNumber},3,3)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>areaCodeToNumber</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>MID({!$Record.ToPhoneNumber},3,3)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>lastfour</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>RIGHT({!$Record.FromPhoneNumber},4)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>lastFourToNumber</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>RIGHT({!$Record.ToPhoneNumber},4)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>phonenumber</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>RIGHT({!$Record.FromPhoneNumber},7)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>VoiceCall_NotOutboundNotAccepted_AssignOwner {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>VoiceCall_NotOutboundNotAccepted_AssignOwner</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
